REGENT OF CENTRAL MALUKU
MALUKU PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF CENTRAL MALUKU
NUMBER 5 YEAR 2022
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN
AND CHILD VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
REGENT OF CENTRAL MALUKU,

Considering : a. that as citizens, women and children have the right to obtain protection from every act of violence committed against them which may result in victims of physical, psychological, sexual violence, or domestic neglect;
b. that protection for women and child victims of violence is an effort to provide a sense of security and freedom from all acts of violence guaranteed by the State;
c. that the government including Regional Government, families, social organizations and or other community organizations have the responsibility to prevent acts of violence and protect women and child victims of violence in accordance with applicable Laws and Regulations;
d. that the Regional Regulation concerning the implementation of protection for women and child victims of violence requires substantial changes related to institutions to be adjusted to the latest regulations at the National level, and has not comprehensively regulated the efforts to implement protection that guarantee the fulfillment of victims' rights to truth, justice, recovery and guarantees of non-recurrence of cases, so that a new Regional Regulation is needed that can guarantee its implementation.
e. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, letter c and letter d, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Child Victims of Violence;

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 60 Year 1958 concerning Stipulation of Emergency Law Number 23 Year 1957 concerning Formation of Level II Autonomous Regions within the Level I Autonomous Region of Maluku (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1958 Number 111, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1645);
3. Law Number 4 Year 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);
4. Law Number 7 Year 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 19, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3668);
5. Law Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
6. Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235) as amended by Law Number 35 Year 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5606);
7. Law Number 13 Year 2003 concerning Manpower (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2003 Number 39, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4279) as amended by Law Number 11 Year 2020 concerning Job Creation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2020 Number 245, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6573);
8. Law Number 23 Year 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);
9. Law Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2006 Number 64, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4635) as amended by Law Number 31 Year 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Protection of Witnesses and Victims (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 293, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5602);
10. Law Number 21 Year 2007 concerning Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);
11. Law Number 36 Year 2009 concerning Health (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2009 Number 144, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5063) as amended by Law Number 11 Year 2020 concerning Job Creation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2020 Number 245, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6573);
12. Law Number 44 Year 2009 concerning Hospitals (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2009 Number 153, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4279) as amended by Law Number 11 Year 2020 concerning Job Creation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2020 Number 245, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6573);
13. Law Number 12 Year 2011 concerning Formation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234) as amended by Law Number 15 Year 2019 concerning Amendment to Law Number 12 Year 2011 concerning Formation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2019 Number 183, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6398);
14. Law Number 16 Year 2011 concerning Legal Aid (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2011 Number 104, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5248);
15. Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as amended several times most recently by Law Number 11 Year 2020 concerning Job Creation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2020 Number 245, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6573);
16. Government Regulation Number 9 Year 2008 concerning Procedures and Mechanisms for Integrated Services for Victims of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2008 Number 22, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4818);
