19. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 6 Year 2015 concerning System for Women and Child Empowerment (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2015 Number 615);
20. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 9 Year 2016 concerning Guidelines for Nomenclature of Regional Apparatus in the Field of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2016 Number 1237);
21. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 1 Year 2017 concerning Governance of Technical Implementation Units for Women and Child Protection (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2017 Number 158);
