Article 2
Principles (1) The protection of women and children is based on Pancasila and the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia as well as the principles and basic rights as regulated in the Convention on Women and Children, including:
a. respect for human rights;
b. non-discrimination;
c. the best interests of women and/or children;
d. the right to life, survival and development;
e. respect for the opinions of women and children; f. gender equality and justice; and
g. protection of victims;
