REGENT OF CENTRAL MALUKU
MALUKU PROVINCE
REGIONAL REGULATION OF CENTRAL MALUKU
NUMBER 5 YEAR 2022
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN
AND CHILD VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
REGENT OF CENTRAL MALUKU,

Considering : a. that as citizens, women and children have the right to obtain protection from every act of violence committed against them which may result in victims of physical, psychological, sexual violence, or domestic neglect;
b. that protection for women and child victims of violence is an effort to provide a sense of security and freedom from all acts of violence guaranteed by the State;
c. that the government including Regional Government, families, social organizations and or other community organizations have the responsibility to prevent acts of violence and protect women and child victims of violence in accordance with applicable Laws and Regulations;
d. that the Regional Regulation concerning the implementation of protection for women and child victims of violence requires substantial changes related to institutions to be adjusted to the latest regulations at the National level, and has not comprehensively regulated the efforts to implement protection that guarantee the fulfillment of victims' rights to truth, justice, recovery and guarantees of non-recurrence of cases, so that a new Regional Regulation is needed that can guarantee its implementation.
e. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, letter c and letter d, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Child Victims of Violence;

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 60 Year 1958 concerning Stipulation of Emergency Law Number 23 Year 1957 concerning Formation of Level II Autonomous Regions within the Level I Autonomous Region of Maluku (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1958 Number 111, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1645);
3. Law Number 4 Year 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3143);
